NegroniMetal change to ios-flame 745c434 phone/metal2 (on top of flame/0001-0010), applied by scripts/metal/fetch-sources.sh:
WebGPU / MSL-source support.
1. newLibraryWithSource:options:error: compiles MSL in the calling process with Apple's own front end (userland/metal/plugin/negroni_msl.h:
   libGPUCompiler MTLGPUCompilerBuildFromSourceToBuffer, the call MTLCompilerService makes), no MTLCompilerService XPC. The metallib goes
   to nmb_library_new. Compile errors answer nil + NSError with the compiler text. NEGRONIMETAL_MSL_FRONTEND=inproc (default) | xpc | 0.
   Crash guard: NMTL_DIR/strikes/msl-<process> (else the temporary directory) holds the boot session while a compile runs.
2. Argument buffers over metal2vulkan's ArgumentEncoder: newArgumentEncoderWithArguments:, -[MTLFunction
   newArgumentEncoderWithBufferIndex:(reflection:)], NBArgumentEncoder (buffers, textures, samplers, pipelines, constantData, nested);
   useResource(s)/useHeap(s) reach the runtime's residency; texture/sampler gpuResourceID = the runtime's resource ID.
3. Indirect work: dispatchThreadgroupsWithIndirectBuffer:, drawPrimitives:indirectBuffer:, drawIndexedPrimitives:...indirectBuffer:,
   the blit copy options: forms. Indirect command buffers stay unbridged: newIndirectCommandBufferWithDescriptor: nil and
   executeCommandsInBuffer: skipped, each logged once.
Bridge: new nmb_argument_encoder_*, nmb_encoder_use_resource/heap, nmb_*_gpu_resource_id, nmb_compute_dispatch_indirect,
nmb_render_draw_(indexed_)indirect, nmb_blit_*_options in NativeMetalObjects.{rs,h}.

