+// buffer's GPU address + offset, a texture's or sampler's gpuResourceID) into the argument buffer set, at once, through its mapping.
+// A refused call is logged (first 8) and writes nothing. Residency is the encoders' useResource(s)/useHeap(s), as on Metal.
